    {
      "id": "u_47279ff75256c827617d0e59_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Prior to v0.104.0, the __TRILIUM_PH_0__desktop application__TRILIUM_PH_1__ would also open a network port so that it can offer access to __TRILIUM_PH_2__ETAPI (REST API)__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or even use it as a web server (see __TRILIUM_PH_4__Using the desktop application as a server__TRILIUM_PH_5__).",
      "sourceHash": "47279ff75256c827617d0e59786b88e989dad3032963152e3ab10e270c7a28e2",
      "context": "Network Access",
      "contextHash": "d1d90f97abb0a5ee89ac835f5fe5ccbdb5ff4d96b24dc1ab44635b7f1ae2252a",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "v0.104.0以前では、__TRILIUM_PH_0__デスクトップアプリケーション__TRILIUM_PH_1__もネットワークポートを開き、__TRILIUM_PH_2__ETAPI (REST API)__TRILIUM_PH_3__へのアクセスを提供したり、Webサーバーとして使用したりすることさえできました（__TRILIUM_PH_4__デスクトップアプリケーションをサーバーとして使用する__TRILIUM_PH_5__を参照してください）。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5cf6f6e1a829a9150088d19a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In order to reduce the attack surface, Trilium now enables these services only for the local device (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_0__) instead of serving them over the LAN.",
      "sourceHash": "5cf6f6e1a829a9150088d19a21553b42d64e414bfcd31b5bcadb7f93b4e3ae44",
      "context": "Network Access",
      "contextHash": "d1d90f97abb0a5ee89ac835f5fe5ccbdb5ff4d96b24dc1ab44635b7f1ae2252a",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "攻撃対象領域を減らすため、Triliumでは、LAN経由でサービスを提供するのではなく、ローカルデバイス（例：__TRILIUM_PH_0__）に対してのみこれらのサービスを有効にするようになりました。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
